<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,379 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,379 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,379</p>
<p>to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX)</p>
<p>from 5,377 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 18		 Sept 17</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,379		   5,377</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)  17.49		   5.16</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
